WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.251 --> 00:00:02.335
A yakuza?

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:05.088
BA-DUMP

00:00:06.715 --> 00:00:08.341
Keep your mouth shut.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:09.718
And no eye contact.

00:00:10.844 --> 00:00:14.639
Do you have a Blu-ray box set of
Crimecatch Policure?

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:17.684
Poli…

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:23.023
Yes, of course,
and there is plenty in stock.

00:00:23.106 --> 00:00:27.235
By the way, which season
of the Blu-ray box set would you like?

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.864
Because there are three versions
of the Blu-ray box sets.

00:00:30.905 --> 00:00:32.615
This is my own personal opinion,

00:00:32.699 --> 00:00:35.702
but I would recommend
the second season of Policure.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:38.955
That's because both the second season's
animation director and scriptwriter

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.458
also worked on the highly acclaimed movie.

00:00:41.541 --> 00:00:43.418
Also, here's some geeky info.

00:00:43.543 --> 00:00:47.047
The director continuously used
a manga style targeted at boy audiences,

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:49.299
so it was worth watching and innovative--

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:51.634
RUSTLE

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.929
Here's the money. Get me the goods pronto.

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.140
I have my own bag.

00:00:57.766 --> 00:00:59.601
And can I have a loyalty card?

